  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| postcss-loader | devDependencies | patch | `2.1.1` -> `2.1.6` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>postcss/postcss-loader</summary>\n\n### [`v2.1.6`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;300httpsgithubcompostcsspostcss-loadercomparev216v300-2018-08-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.5...v2.1.6)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **index:** add ast version (`meta.ast`) ([f34954f](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/f34954f))\n-   **index:** emit `warnings` as an instance of `{Error}` ([8ac6fb5](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/8ac6fb5))\n-   **options:** improved `ValidationError` messages ([549ea08](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/549ea08))\n\n##### Chores\n\n-   **package:** update `postcss` v6.0.0...7.0.0 (`dependencies`) ([#&#8203;375](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/375)) ([daa0da8](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/daa0da8))\n\n##### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n-   **package:** requires `node >= v6.0.0`\n\n#### [2.1.6](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.5...v2.1.6) (2018-07-10)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **package:** config memory leak, updates `postcss-load-config` v1.2.0...2.0.0 (`dependencies`) ([0547b12](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/0547b12))\n\n#### [2.1.5](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.4...v2.1.5) (2018-05-04)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **index:** remove `sourceMap` warning ([#&#8203;361](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/361)) ([4416791](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/4416791))\n\n#### [2.1.4](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.3...v2.1.4) (2018-04-16)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   restore loader object in postcss config context ([#&#8203;355](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/355)) ([2ff1735](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/2ff1735))\n\n#### [2.1.3](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.2...v2.1.3) (2018-03-20)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **options:** revert additionalProperties changes to keep SemVer ([bd7fc38](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/bd7fc38))\n\n#### [2.1.2](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.1...v2.1.2) (2018-03-17)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **options:** disallow additional properties and add `ident` to validation ([#&#8203;346](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/346)) ([82ef553](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/82ef553))\n\n#### [2.1.1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.0...v2.1.1) (2018-02-26)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **index:** don't set `to` value (`options`) ([#&#8203;339](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/339)) ([cdbb8b6](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/cdbb8b6))\n\n### [`v2.1.5`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;216httpsgithubcompostcsspostcss-loadercomparev215v216-2018-07-10)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.4...v2.1.5)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **package:** config memory leak, updates `postcss-load-config` v1.2.0...2.0.0 (`dependencies`) ([0547b12](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/0547b12))\n\n### [`v2.1.4`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;215httpsgithubcompostcsspostcss-loadercomparev214v215-2018-05-04)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.3...v2.1.4)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **index:** remove `sourceMap` warning ([#&#8203;361](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/361)) ([4416791](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/4416791))\n\n### [`v2.1.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;214httpsgithubcompostcsspostcss-loadercomparev213v214-2018-04-16)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.2...v2.1.3)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   restore loader object in postcss config context ([#&#8203;355](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/issues/355)) ([2ff1735](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/2ff1735))\n\n### [`v2.1.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;213httpsgithubcompostcsspostcss-loadercomparev212v213-2018-03-20)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/compare/v2.1.1...v2.1.2)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **options:** revert additionalProperties changes to keep SemVer ([bd7fc38](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/postcss-loader/commit/bd7fc38))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
